<title>RUSSIA: Russia C. Bank repays 5.33 trln rbls bonds early.</title>
<headline>Russia C. Bank repays 5.33 trln rbls bonds early.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's central bank repaid 5.33 trillion roubles ($920 million) of series 24006 OFZ interest-bearing bonds early, the bank's open-market operations department said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The current volume of series 24006 bond in circulation fell to 1.09 trillion roubles from 6.42 trillion roubles, it said.</p>
<p>The central bank is now withdrawing tax-exempt paper from circulation by repaying such issues early. ($ = 5,805 roubles)</p>
<p>--Anna Smirnova, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
